    {
      "reviewtitle": "Allies duped by the Jewish Bankers yet again, Allies should apologise for planning and starting WW2",
      "reviewbody": "The last thing Hitler wanted was another great war.\"Basil Liddell Hart\n\nI see no reason why this war must go on.I am grieved to think of the sacrifices which it will claim.I would like to avert them.Hitler,Jul1940\n\nWe entered the war of our own free will, without ourselves being directly assaulted Churchill,Guild Hall Speech,Jul1943\n\nIn no country has historical blackout been more intense,effective than in Great Britain, ingeniously christened The Iron Curtain of Discreet Silence,nothing has been written to reveal  truth British responsible for WW2 and its disastrous results.Harry Elmer Barnes.Am Historian\n\nApr1939,Ambass Bullitt,said war decided upon.Karl Wiegand,Apr23,1944,Chicago Herald American\n\nI felt sorry for the German people.We were planning and we had the force to carry out our plans to obliterate a mighty nation.Admiral D Leahy;U.S Ambassador\n\nBritains,Lord Halifax reported as being 'redeemed'.He ordered beer.We laughed,joked\nH.Roth\narchive dot org/details/jwo-april-2025\n",
